  "_doc": "Demo system map for sysmap-to-miro. Entirely invented. Highlights icon inference across a wider service mix (Fargate/ECS, EventBridge, SNS, SES, DynamoDB, S3) and external systems (a payment gateway and a partner warehouse) that fall back to the neutral 'users' icon. Run: node bin/ir-to-miro.mjs examples/ecommerce-checkout.architecture.json --iconset aws",
